From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:47:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 063/111] Two views: drag the divider to resize them

The divider between the two views can be dragged; the pointer shows a
resize cursor over a strip around it. Each view keeps at least 240 px, and
a window too narrow for two such views splits evenly. Letting go of the
mouse anywhere in the window ends the drag. The left view's share is kept
in the session, so the split comes back as it was; a new split starts even.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

